menu "PlantHub Zigbee"

config PLANTHUB_ZB_ENABLED
    bool "Enable the Zigbee coordinator"
    default y if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
    default n
    help
        The Zigbee coordinator needs an 802.15.4 radio AND the
        zb_storage/zb_fct partitions that partitions_16m.csv provides.
        Only the esp32c6 has both, which is why this defaults off
        everywhere else: the 4 MB esp32c5 leg has neither the partitions
        nor the app-slot headroom (M6a spec section 2).

config PLANTHUB_ZB_PERMIT_JOIN_S
    int "Permit-join window (seconds)"
    default 180
    range 30 254
    help
        How long the network accepts new devices after the user presses
        Pair. The window is a window, never a mode: it closes on expiry,
        on a successful join, and on reboot. A permanently open network
        lets any device in radio range join.

endmenu
